WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.720
If your prep is SuTab, this video will walk you through exactly how to take

2
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:04.080
it.

3
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:08.560
Just follow along step by step. Your SuTab kit includes two bottles of 12

4
00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:09.360
tablets each and

5
00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:13.810
a measured container. Start your first dose between 6 and 7 p.m. the night

6
00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:14.960
before your procedure.

7
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:19.560
Open your first bottle of 12 tablets. Fill the provided container with 16

8
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.640
ounces of water up to

9
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:25.100
the fill line. Swallow one tablet every two minutes with a sip of water,

10
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.480
finishing all 12 tablets

11
00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:31.760
over about 15 to 20 minutes. Take your time and go at a steady pace. About one

12
00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:33.040
hour after your last

13
00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:37.260
tablet, fill the container again with 16 ounces of water and drink the entire

14
00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.320
amount slowly over

15
00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:42.530
30 minutes. Then about 30 minutes after finishing that container, fill it one

16
00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:43.520
more time with 16

17
00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:47.740
ounces of water and drink the entire amount over 30 minutes. That completes

18
00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:48.640
your first dose.

19
00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:54.000
Repeat the exact same three steps using your second bottle of 12 tablets.

20
00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:58.860
One tablet every two minutes with water, then 16 ounces of water, one hour

21
00:00:58.860 --> 00:00:59.200
later,

22
00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:03.920
then 16 ounces of water, 30 minutes after that.

23
00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:04.640
You must drink

24
00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:08.780
all of the prep solution as directed, even if you're already passing clear

25
00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:09.040
liquid.

26
00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:12.550
I know it can feel like enough, but finishing the entire dose is what gives us

27
00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:13.120
the clearest

28
00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:17.330
view during your procedure. If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may

29
00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:18.160
need to reschedule,

30
00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:22.330
and neither of us wants that. Between doses, keep drinking clear liquids to

31
00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:22.880
stay hydrated,

32
00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:27.080
it will help you feel better, and help the prep do its job. Do not drink

33
00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:27.760
anything at all within

34
00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:31.970
two hours of your arrival time, including water. Your procedure may be canceled

35
00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:32.800
or rescheduled if

36
00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:36.670
this is not followed. If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to

37
00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:37.440
the bathroom,

38
00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:41.630
applying a petroleum-based ointment or diaper rash cream can really help. That

39
00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:42.720
's it. You've got this.

40
00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:47.760
Follow the timing, finish the full dose, and stay hydrated. If you have any

41
00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:48.720
questions at all,

42
00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:51.760
don't hesitate to call our office. We're here to help.
